<transltr>
<title>REVISION TRANSMITTAL SHEET</title>
<para>TO: HOLDERS OF COMPONENT MAINTENANCE MANUAL 25-26-62</para>
<para>Latest Revision is attached.</para>
<para>DEFINITIONS</para>
<unlist bulltype="none">
<unlitem><?Pub Dtl>
<para>R = REVISION</para>
</unlitem>
<unlitem><?Pub Dtl>
<para>N = NEW</para>
</unlitem>
<unlitem><?Pub Dtl>
<para>D = DELETED</para>
</unlitem>
</unlist>
<para>FILING INSTRUCTIONS</para>
<unlist bulltype="ndash">
<unlitem><?Pub Dtl>
<para>Affected pages are listed on the "LIST OF EFFECTIVE PAGES".</para>
</unlitem>
<unlitem><?Pub Dtl>
<para>Make certain that the content of the manual is in compliance
with the LIST OF EFFECTIVE PAGES.</para>
</unlitem>
<unlitem><?Pub Dtl>
<para>File the REVISION TRANSMITTAL SHEET separately.</para>
</unlitem>
<unlitem><?Pub Dtl>
<para>Replace issue Revision 2 with this complete issue Revision 3.</para>
</unlitem>
</unlist>
<para>REASON FOR ISSUE:</para>
<para>CMM Updated.</para>
<para>The attached HIGHLIGHTS pages detail the changes.</para>
</transltr>
