<pgblk chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" pgblknbr="0" chg="r"
key="pgblk-25-26-62-0" revdate="20261016">
<title>INTRODUCTION</title>
<task chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="99F" seq="801"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="0" chg="u"
key="task-25-26-62-99f-801-a01" revdate="20260617">
<title>General</title>
<topic>
<prclist1><?Pub Dtl>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>The instructions in this manual give the
information necessary to do maintenance functions from checks and
replacement to complete shop type repair.</para>
<note><para>All tasks included in this CMM are to be done by approved
personnel.</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Any feedback or queries on this document
can be sent to <?sr?><?tic blue??>product.support.gb.sst@customer.safrangroup.com<?tic ??>.
</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>For CMM access requests, contact <?tic blue??>tech.pubs.gb.sst@customer.safrangroup.com<?tic ??>.
</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</topic>
</task>
