<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Warnings, Cautions and Notes:</para></prcitem>
<prclist2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Warnings:</para></prcitem>
<prclist3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Warnings call attention to use of materials,
processes, methods, procedures, or limits which must be obeyed correctly
to prevent injury to persons.</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Warnings must be given directly above the
text to which they relate.</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
</prclist3>
</prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Cautions:</para></prcitem>
<prclist3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Cautions call attention to methods and procedures
which must be obeyed to prevent damage to equipment.</para></prcitem>
</prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Cautions must be given directly above the
text to which they relate.</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
</prclist3>
</prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Notes:</para></prcitem>
<prclist3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Notes call attention to methods which make
the job easier.</para></prcitem></prcitem3>
<prcitem3><prcitem><para>Notes must be given directly below to the
text that they follow and to which they relate.</para></prcitem>
</prcitem3>
</prclist3>
