<title>Technical Event Notification Sheet</title>
<topic>
<prclist1><?Pub Dtl>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>The Technical Event Notification Sheet can
be used to communicate directly with Safran Seats GB Limited, related
to the product and/or CMM.</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>The Technical Event Notification Sheet can
be accessed at: <?sr?><?tic blue??>https://techpubs.customers.safran-seats.com/user/library<?tic ??>.
</para>
<note><para>Please complete this Technical Event Notification Sheet
and email it to: <?tic blue??>product.support.gb.sst@customer.safrangroup.com<?tic ??>.
</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</topic>
</task>
<?pb?>
