<pgblk chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" pgblknbr="1" chg="r"
key="pgblk-25-26-62-1" revdate="20261016">
<title>DESCRIPTION AND OPERATION</title>
<task chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="870" seq="801"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="1" chg="u"
key="task-25-26-62-870-801-a-01" revdate="20260617">
<title>General</title>
<topic>
<prclist1><?Pub Dtl>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>This manual contains maintenance and repair
instructions together with an illustrated parts list for FD9334624
series furniture assemblies fitted to business class suites installed
in 787-9 aircraft. Information about the business class seat is given
in Safran Seats GB Limited CMM 25-26-61.</para></prcitem>
<prclist2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 1 shows the 787-9 suite layout.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 2 shows the overall dimensions of
suite assembly.</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 3 shows the typical features of the
furniture assemblies and sub-assemblies.</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 4 shows the main PCU and privacy PCU.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 5 shows the location of the lifevest.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 6 shows the deployment and stowage
of meal table assembly.</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 7 shows the line replaceable units.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 8 shows the privacy screen manual
operation.</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 9 shows the full height dropping privacy
screen locking feature.</para></prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Figure 10 shows the suite door operation.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
</prclist2>
</prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Description and Operation Procedures:</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
