<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Consumables for Isovolta Decor Laminate Products:
</para>
<note><para>The solvents and cleaning agents are applicable only for
the Isovolta decor laminate products.</para></note>
<note><para>The solvents and cleaning agents do not affect the decorative
films top layer after 24 hrs. contact at 23&deg;C, Refer to Table <refint
reftype="ELEMENT" refid="table-25-26-62-99a-074-a01"></refint>.</para>
</note>
</prcitem>
