<topic>
<title>Repair 3-1. Helicoil insert replacement:</title>
<subtask chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="300" seq="005"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="6000" chg="u"
key="subtask-25-26-62-300-005-a01" revdate="20260617"><?Pub Dtl>
<title>Procedure:</title>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<warning><para>WHEN threaded inserts are replaced, OBEY ALL PROCEDURE
INSTRUCTIONS AND HEALTH AND SAFETY WARNINGS SUPPLIED BY THE MANUFACTURER.
THIS WILL HELP PREVENT INJURY.</para></warning>
<caution><para>you must Contact Safran Seats GB LIMITED for information
on the correct insert part number to be installed. IF YOU DO NOT OBEY
THIS INSTRUCTION THERE IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para></caution>
<para>Refer to the insert manufacturers instructions for insert installation.
</para>
<note><para>Refer to table <refint reftype="ELEMENT"
refid="table-25-26-62-99a-032-a01">table-25-26-62-99a-032-a01</refint> for
replacement helicoil inserts.</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
