<topic>
<title>Repair 3-2. Potted insert replacement (Ref. Fig. 6001):</title>
<subtask chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="300" seq="006"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="6000" chg="u"
key="subtask-25-26-62-300-006-a01" revdate="20260617"><?Pub Dtl>
<title>Procedure:</title>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<caution><para>you must contact safran seats gb LIMITED to make sure
that the inserts are in a location which is applicable for this repair.
IF YOU DO NOT OBEY THIS INSTRUCTION THERE IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE
UNIT.</para></caution>
<caution><para>you must Contact Safran Seats GB LIMITED for information
on the correct insert part number to be installed. IF YOU DO NOT OBEY
THIS INSTRUCTION THERE IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para></caution>
<para>Remove the damaged insert and the adhesive inside the hole.</para>
<note><para>Refer to table <refint reftype="ELEMENT"
refid="table-25-26-62-99a-056-a01">table-25-26-62-99a-056-a01</refint> for
replacement potted inserts.</para></note>
<note><para>Refer to <refint reftype="ELEMENT" refid="vendlist-25-26-62">
vendlist-25-26-62</refint> for vendor addresses.</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<?eval =v1612x(75)?>
<?eval +1?x(75)[?pb?]?>
