<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Install a new insert into the hole and hold
in position with the installation tab.</para>
<note><para>A self-adhesive installation tab is supplied with a new
insert.</para></note>
<note><para>If necessary, masking tape can be used to hold thru hole
inserts in position.</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<warning><para>WHEN adhesives ARE USED, OBEY ALL PROCEDURE INSTRUCTIONS
AND HEALTH AND SAFETY WARNINGS SUPPLIED BY THE MANUFACTURER. THIS
WILL HELP PREVENT INJURY.</para></warning>
<para>Mix together two part adhesive (AW2104 opaque base and HY4076
pale yellow hardener).</para>
<note><para>To mix together the adhesive: add 100 parts by weight
of base to 40 parts by weight of hardener and mix together. Make sure
that when mixed the compounds are a constant colour.</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Apply the adhesive to one hole on the insert
until it flows from the second hole on the insert.</para></prcitem>
</prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Apply the adhesive to the second hole on
the insert until it flows back from the first hole.</para></prcitem>
</prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<warning><para>WHEN SOLVENTS AND CLEANING AGENTS ARE USED, OBEY ALL
PROCEDURE INSTRUCTIONS AND HEALTH AND SAFETY WARNINGS SUPPLIED BY
THE MANUFACTURER. THIS WILL HELP PREVENT INJURY.</para></warning>
<para>Remove unwanted adhesive with Isopropyl alcohol and a lint free
cloth.</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Remove installation tab and masking tape
if used, when handling cure time is completed.</para>
<note><para>Handling cure time 7 hours at 23 deg C (73.4 deg F).</para>
</note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Let the adhesive fully cure.</para>
<note><para>Adhesive full cure time 16 hours at 23 deg C (73.4 deg
F).</para></note>
</prcitem><graphic chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="99B"
seq="113" confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="6000" chg="u"
key="graphic-25-26-62-99b-113-a01" revdate="20260617">
<title>POTTED INSERT REPLACEMENT</title>
<sheet gnbr="ent252662-REP-6001-01-00.cgm" sheetnbr="1" chg="u"
key="sheet-25-26-62-99b-113-a01-1" revdate="20260617"></sheet>
</graphic></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</subtask>
</topic>
</task>
