<note><para>Let the adhesive dry for a minimum of 30 minutes.</para>
</note>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Attach the bonded part magnets (310) to the
tray table strip cladding (295) in position.</para>
<note><para>Adhesive cure time is 0.5 hours at 60.8 deg F to 80.6
deg F (16 deg C to 27 deg C).</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
<prcitem2><prcitem><para>Remove unwanted adhesive with lint-free cloth.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem2>
</prclist2>
</prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>For Assembly 1B, 1C, 1D, 1G, 1K, 1L, 1N and
1P: Attach the tray table strip cladding (295) with two countersunk
head screws (300) and two countersunk finishing washers (305).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Assemble the aft tray cladding assembly (255):</para>
</prcitem>
<prclist2>
