confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="12000" chg="u"
key="subtask-25-26-62-010-007-a01" revdate="20260318"><?Pub Dtl>
<title>Removal of the RGBW Light (Ref. IPL Fig. 7-80, 7-80A, 7-80B,
8-90, 8-90A, 8-90B, 8-90D, 8-90E, 8-90F, 8-90G) from the Electrical
