</caution>
<para>Get access to the RGBW light (7-80, 7-80A, 7-80B, 8-90, 8-90A,
8-90B, 8-90D, 8-90E, 8-90F, 8-90G).</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Disconnect the RGBW light (7-80, 7-80A, 7-80B,
8-90, 8-90A, 8-90B, 8-90D, 8-90E, 8-90F, 8-90G) connector P1 from
the harness assembly (7-115, 8-125) at connector J10.</para></prcitem>
</prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Remove and collect the RGBW light (7-80,
7-80A, 7-80B, 8-90, 8-90A, 8-90B, 8-90D, 8-90E, 8-90F, 8-90G).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</subtask>
<subtask chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="010" seq="008"
