<subtask chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="010" seq="009"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="12000" chg="u"
key="subtask-25-26-62-010-009-a01" revdate="20260318"><?Pub Dtl>
<title>Removal of the Mood Light (Ref. IPL Fig. 7-90, 8-100) from
the Electrical Installation (Ref. IPL Fig. 7 and 8):</title>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<warning><para>MAKE SURE THAT UNIT HAS BEEN ISOLATED FROM THE ELECTRICAL
SUPPLY BY THE APPROVED PERSONNEL. IF YOU DO NOT OBEY THESE INSTRUCTIONS
THERE IS A RISK OF INJURY or death.</para></warning>
<caution><para>NO RINGS, WATCHES OR ITEMS HANGING FROM BELTS ARE TO
BE WORN DURING REMOVAL. IF YOU DO NOT OBEY THIS INSTRUCTION THERE
IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para></caution>
<caution><para>DO NOT USE POWER TOOLS DURING REMOVAL, IF YOU DO NOT
OBEY THIS INSTRUCTION THERE IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para>
</caution>
<para>Get access to the mood light (7-90, 8-100).</para></prcitem>
</prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Disconnect the mood light (7-90, 8-100) connector
P1 from the harness assembly (7-115, 8-125) at connector J8.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Remove and collect the mood light (7-90,
8-100).</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</subtask>
