<caution><para>DO NOT USE POWER TOOLS DURING REMOVAL, IF YOU DO NOT
OBEY THIS INSTRUCTION THERE IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para>
</caution>
<para>Get access to the smart audio adapter (7-220, 8-210).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Disconnect the smart audio adapter (7-220,
8-210) connectors J1, J2 from the harness assembly (7-250, 8-240,
7-245, 8-235) at connectors P1, P2.</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
