<subtask chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="010" seq="014"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="12000" chg="u"
key="subtask-25-26-62-010-014-a01" revdate="20260318"><?Pub Dtl>
<title>Removal of the Remote Jack (Ref. IPL Fig. 7-225, 8-215) from
the Electrical Installation (Ref. IPL Fig. 7 and 8):</title>
<prclist1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<warning><para>MAKE SURE THAT UNIT HAS BEEN ISOLATED FROM THE ELECTRICAL
SUPPLY BY THE APPROVED PERSONNEL. IF YOU DO NOT OBEY THESE INSTRUCTIONS
THERE IS A RISK OF INJURY or death.</para></warning>
<caution><para>NO RINGS, WATCHES OR ITEMS HANGING FROM BELTS ARE TO
BE WORN DURING REMOVAL. IF YOU DO NOT OBEY THIS INSTRUCTION THERE
IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para></caution>
<caution><para>DO NOT USE POWER TOOLS DURING REMOVAL, IF YOU DO NOT
OBEY THIS INSTRUCTION THERE IS A RISK OF DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para>
</caution>
<para>Get access to the seat surround cladding assembly (22-100).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem>
<caution><para>SEPARATION OF HOOK AND LOOP FASTENERS MUST BE DONE
CAREFULLY TO PREVENT DAMAGE TO THE UNIT.</para></caution>
<para>Disengage the self-adhesive duotec fasteners, remove one hexagon
head screws (22-115), two countersunk head screws (22-120), two countersunk
finishing washers (22-125) and collect the seat surround cladding
assembly (22-110) from the seat recess claddings installation (22-1).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Get access and remove the upper console stowage
installation (5-145, 6-145) from the furniture assembly.</para>
<note><para>Refer to Fig 17 IPL for the Upper Console Stowage Installation
details.</para></note>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Disconnect the remote jack (7-225, 8-215)
connector J1 from the harness assembly (7-250, 8-240) at connector
P13.</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Remove the screw (part of remote jack) and
collect the remote jack (7-225, 8-215) from the cocktail table assembly
(12-1).</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
</subtask>
<subtask chapnbr="25" sectnbr="26" subjnbr="62" func="010" seq="015"
confltr="A" varnbr="01" pgblknbr="12000" chg="u"
key="subtask-25-26-62-010-015-a01" revdate="20260318"><?Pub Dtl>
