</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Disconnect the next premium expansion unit
(7-520, 8-520) connectors J4, J1 from the harness assembly (7-155,
8-165, 7-495, 8-490) at connectors P4, P1.</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Remove and collect the next premium expansion
unit (7-520, 8-520).</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
</prclist1>
