</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Attach the outlet unit (7-230, 8-220) to
the cocktail table assembly (12-1) with screw (part of outlet unit).</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Connect the outlet unit (7-230, 8-220) connectors
P7, P14 to the harness assembly (7-330, 8-320) at connectors P7, P14.</para>
</prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Engage the self-adhesive duotec fasteners,
attach the seat surround cladding assembly (22-110) to the seat recess
