socket cap head screw (7-275, 8-265).</para></prcitem></prcitem1>
<prcitem1><prcitem><para>Connect the monitor (7-270, 8-260) to the
harness assembly (7-285, 8-275) at connector P10.</para></prcitem>
</prcitem1>
